# Content pipeline drafts. Approved records ARE committed — the audit trail of
# what was approved and by whom belongs in the repository history, which is
# where it is useful a year later. Only in-flight drafts are ignored.
/content/pipeline/*.draft.json

# The knowledge export is generated (npm run knowledge:sync) and committed, so
# a diff shows what actually changed when content moved. Nothing to ignore.

# Visibility observations ARE committed — the value of the data is the trend.
/content/visibility/report.json
